  "job_A3.8_20251003_114216": {
    "text": "\u00d0us frod f\u00e6der freobearn l\u00e6rde, modsnottor mon, maga cystum eald, wordum wisf\u00e6stum, \u00fe\u00e6t he wel\nWene \u00feec \u00fey betran, efn elne \u00feis a \u00feenden \u00feu lifge.\nF\u00e6der ond modor freo \u00feu mid heortan, maga gehwylcne, gif him sy meotud on lufan.\nWes \u00feu \u00feinum yldrum arf\u00e6st symle, f\u00e6gerwyrde, ond \u00fee in fer\u00f0e l\u00e6t \u00feine lareowas leofe in mode, \u00fea\nF\u00e6der eft his sunu frod gegrette o\u00fere si\u00fee: Heald elne \u00feis.\nNe freme firene, ne n\u00e6fre freonde \u00feinum, m\u00e6ge man ne ge\u00feafa, \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00feec meotud oncunne, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu sy\nHe \u00fee mid wite gielde\u00f0, swylce \u00feam o\u00ferum mid eadwelan.\n\u00d0riddan sy\u00fee \u00feoncsnottor guma breostgehygdum his bearn l\u00e6rde: Ne gewuna wyrsa, widan feore,\nSy ymb rice swa hit m\u00e6ge.\nFeor\u00fean si\u00f0e f\u00e6der eft l\u00e6rde modleofne magan, \u00fe\u00e6t he gemunde \u00feis: Ne aswic sundorwine, ac a symle\nR\u00e6fn elne \u00feis, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu n\u00e6fre f\u00e6cne weor\u00f0e freonde \u00feinum.\nFiftan si\u00fee f\u00e6der eft ongon breostge\u00feoncum his bearn l\u00e6ran: Druncen beorg \u00fee ond dollic word, man\nFor\u00f0on sceal \u00e6wiscmod oft si\u00feian, se \u00fee gewite\u00f0 in wifes lufan, fremdre meowlan.\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00f0 a firena wen, la\u00f0licre scome, long ni\u00f0 wi\u00f0 god, geotende gielp.\nWes \u00feu a giedda wis, w\u00e6r wi\u00f0 willan, worda hyrde.\nSiextan si\u00fee sw\u00e6s eft ongon \u00feurh bli\u00f0ne ge\u00feoht his bearn l\u00e6ran: Ongiet georne hw\u00e6t sy god o\u00fe\u00fee yfel,\nA \u00fee bi\u00f0 ged\u00e6led; gif \u00fee deah hyge, wuna\u00f0 wisdom in, ond \u00feu wast geare ondgit yfles, heald \u00fee elne\nSeofe\u00fean si\u00fee his sunu l\u00e6rde f\u00e6der, frod guma, s\u00e6gde fela geongum: Seldan snottor guma sorgleas\nW\u00e6rwyrde sceal wisf\u00e6st h\u00e6le breostum hycgan, nales breahtme hlud.\nEahto\u00fean si\u00fee eald f\u00e6der ongon his mago monian mildum wordum: Leorna lare l\u00e6rgedefe, wene \u00feec in\nNige\u00fean si\u00fee n\u00e6gde se gomola, eald u\u00f0wita s\u00e6gde eaforan worn: nis nu fela folca \u00fe\u00e6tte fyrngewritu\nMonig sceal ongieldan sawelsusles.\nAc l\u00e6t \u00feinne sefan healdan for\u00f0 fyrngewritu ond frean domas, \u00fea \u00fee her on m\u00e6g\u00f0e gehw\u00e6re men\nTeo\u00fean si\u00fee tornsorgna ful, eald eft ongon eaforan l\u00e6ran: Snyttra bruce\u00fe \u00fee fore sawle lufan warna\u00f0\nYrre ne l\u00e6t \u00fee \u00e6fre gewealdan, heah in hre\u00fere, heoroworda grund wylme bismitan, ac him warna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nH\u00e6le sceal wisf\u00e6st ond gemetlice, modes snottor, gleaw in gehygdum, georn wisdomes, swa he wi\u00f0\nNe beo \u00feu no to t\u00e6lende, ne to tweospr\u00e6ce, ne \u00fee on mode l\u00e6t men to fraco\u00fee, ac beo leofwende, leoht\nSwa \u00feu, min bearn, gemyne frode f\u00e6der lare ond \u00feec a wi\u00f0 firenum geheald.",
